=== NATURAL ===
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #TEXT        (A30)
1 #OCCURRENCES (I4)
END-DEFINE
EXAMINE #TEXT FOR ' ' GIVING NUMBER #OCCURRENCES
EXAMINE #TEXT FOR '-' REPLACE WITH '/'

=== PYTHON ===
class ExamineContext:
    def __init__(self):
        self.text = ""
        self.occurrences = 0

def execute_examine(ctx: ExamineContext, session):
    ctx.occurrences = ctx.text.count(str(' '))
    ctx.text = ctx.text.replace(str('-'), str('/'))
    return ctx

=== EXECUTE ===
- input:
    text: "2026-09-28 date"
  expected:
    occurrences: 1
    text: "2026/09/28 date"

- input:
    text: "A-B-C-D"
  expected:
    occurrences: 0
    text: "A/B/C/D"
